            "description": "Adds an option to scroll chat messages across the video on live streams, Niconico style, in landscape fullscreen and optionally in portrait, the mini player and picture in picture. A button in the player turns it on and off, and the rows, speed, number of comments, font and colors can be changed in the uyu settings. An option hides Twitch's chat in landscape so the stream fills the screen. Streams open in Twitch's native player instead of the new React Native one, which this relies on.",
