        {
            "name": "Fix login",
            "description": "Fixes the \"This app version/OS is not currently supported\" error that blocks login after patching. Twitch reports a Play Integrity result to its login server and the re-signed app fails that check. This stops the app from sending the attestation, so it behaves like a device without Google Play, where login works normally.",
            "default": true,
