        {
            "name": "Fix notifications",
            "description": "Fixes push notifications after patching. Firebase rejects device registration because the patched app has a different signing certificate, and a different package name when it is installed as a separate app. This sends Twitch's original certificate fingerprint and package name with Firebase Installations requests only.",
